# Next.js App Router

- Routes under `src/app/` — use Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed.
- Shared layout: `src/app/layout.tsx`, metadata in page files or `layout.tsx`.
- Workshop content from `src/lib/workshop-data.ts` — avoid hardcoding lab lists in pages.
- External platform links: `platformUrl("/login")` from `src/lib/site-config.ts`.
- UI: shadcn in `src/components/ui/`; page chrome via `PageShell`, `PageHero`, `SectionTitle`.
- Styling: Tailwind + CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css` (Apple design tokens).

Before using newer Next APIs, check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — this project may use conventions that differ from older Next versions.
